Looking at the maven documentation it looks like mvn.bat should be created by the installation process. https://maven.apache.org/guides/getting-started/windows-prerequisites.html

If you do have a mvn.cmd you want to use you can modify the Makefile (file named Makefile.win) and it should pick things up

Thanks
Shivaram

